    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick, mini.extra\n\n### Description\n\nHi echasnovski! Is it in scope to add a picker to mini.extra to show call heirarchy recursively till a given depth something like what this plugin does https://github.com/jmacadie/telescope-hierarchy.nvim.\nBasically add support to incoming_calls and outgoing_calls if possible with recursive support till a certain depth.",
